//         the last sticks fall SHORT on the blue line: red pulse + FRIENDLY FIRE stamp.
// hook-2: smoke over the craters; WHITE-FLASH cut -> 31 JULY: blue armour bursts south through the gap, red counters grey, FRONT TORN
//         OPEN; zoom-out whoosh (option 1, 31 July): arrows pour south to Avranches; Patton badge + arrows race into Brittany / France;
//         a big red ? over the arrows and NOT PATTON.
// hook-3: hard cut to dark, the date rolls back to 25 JULY; short bombs replay on the blue line, 111 KILLED · 490 WOUNDED, McNair's
//         three-star badge greyed (A GENERAL AMONG THE DEAD), mystery "?" badge (the name comes in hook-4); infantry crawl through the
//         craters and stall (STALLED, radio static); WAIT? struck out; big tank counters SLAM into the line and burst through.
